fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"applib/gstappsrc.html#GstAppSrcSeekDataCallback","fragment":"\n\tGstAppSrcSeekDataCallback\n\n\n\tGstApp.AppSrcSeekDataCallback\n\n\n\tGstApp.AppSrcSeekDataCallback\n\nCalled when a seek should be performed to the offset. The next push-buffer\nshould produce buffers from the new offset. This callback is only called for\nseekable stream types.\nParameters:\na GstAppSrc\nOffset to seek to.\ncallback user data\nTRUE if the seek was successful.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nCalled when a seek should be performed to the offset. The next push-buffer\nshould produce buffers from the new offset. This callback is only called for\nseekable stream types.\nParameters:\na GstApp.AppSrc\nOffset to seek to.\ncallback user data\ntrue if the seek was successful.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nCalled when a seek should be performed to the offset. The next push-buffer\nshould produce buffers from the new offset. This callback is only called for\nseekable stream types.\nParameters:\na GstApp.AppSrc\nOffset to seek to.\ncallback user data\nTrue if the seek was successful.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});